SPDX-License-Identifier: GPL-3.0-or-later

The full canonical text of GPL v3 lives in `LICENSES/GPL-3.0-or-later.txt`
(the conventional REUSE / SPDX layout). For the upstream source, see:

    https://www.gnu.org/licenses/gpl-3.0.txt

A copy must be present in `LICENSES/` for `reuse lint` to pass. If the
file is missing in your checkout, fetch it once from the URL above:

    mkdir -p LICENSES
    curl -L https://www.gnu.org/licenses/gpl-3.0.txt -o LICENSES/GPL-3.0-or-later.txt

You can also obtain the canonical text from any GNU mirror or from the
`reuse` tool's bundled SPDX license registry:

    reuse download GPL-3.0-or-later
